prompt.userPromptTemplate:
Resolve cultural/religious occasion date ranges for a school informational calendar.

Year: {{year}}
Occasion names (comma-separated): {{occasions}}
Region hint: {{regionHint}}
Notes: {{calendarNotes}}

Return JSON with an occasions array. Each item: name, startDate, endDate (YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive, within year {{year}}), calendarSystem (gregorian|islamic|hindu_lunar|chinese_lunar|other), confidence (high|medium|low), notes (short sourcing note).
